    "handle": "lazarat-griffon-diving-200-1",
    "title": "Lazarat Griffon Diving 200",
    "descriptionHtml": "<p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\">Floating 200mm 100g&nbsp;</p><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\">Rigging option:</p><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\">Hooks: Bkk lone diablo 9/0 or Bkk raptor z 4/0 (weight 8-9g)</p><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\">Split rings: size 10</p><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\">Action:</p><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\">When retrieved quickly with a long swipe, it leaves a bubble trail behind, wobbling its body underwater. On shorter swipes and slower retrieves, it offers versatility, allowing you to experiment with various techniques. Fish often strike when it surfaces after a pull, so it’s best to pause for a second and let it float between retrieves.&nbsp;</p><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\">The Griffon is a slim-style wooden floating lure series, featuring smallmouth poppers and diving poppers in various sizes. It offers long, stable casting, is easy to use, and highly durable. Built with a 2mm stainless steel through-body construction and coated with six layers of premium-quality epoxy for maximum durability.&nbsp;</p><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\"><br /></p>",
